  <ReportSections>
    <ReportSection>
      <Body>
        <ReportItems>
          <Textbox Name="Textbox1">
            <CanGrow>true</CanGrow>
            <KeepTogether>true</KeepTogether>
            <Paragraphs>
              <Paragraph>
                <TextRuns>
                  <TextRun>
                    <Value>Dear Sir/ Madam, 

</Value>
                    <Style>
                      <FontFamily>Times New Roman</FontFamily>
                    </Style>
                  </TextRun>
                  <TextRun>
                    <Value>RE: SECOND AND FINAL DEMAND NOTICE</Value>
                    <Style>
                      <FontFamily>Times New Roman</FontFamily>
                      <FontWeight>Bold</FontWeight>
                      <TextDecoration>Underline</TextDecoration>
                    </Style>
                  </TextRun>
                  <TextRun>
                    <Value>

Reference is made to our letter dated _______________________ regarding your loan facility at KAG Sacco Society in arrears.  We write to notify you that your loan facility is still in arrears and outstanding as follows:

Interest Arrears	Kes. </Value>
                    <Style>
                      <FontFamily>Times New Roman</FontFamily>
                    </Style>
                  </TextRun>
                  <TextRun>
                    <Value>=Fields!IntArrears.Value</Value>
                    <Style>
                      <FontFamily>Times New Roman</FontFamily>
                      <Format>n2</Format>
                    </Style>
                  </TextRun>
                  <TextRun>
                    <Value>
Principal Arrears	Kes. </Value>
                    <Style>
                      <FontFamily>Times New Roman</FontFamily>
                    </Style>
                  </TextRun>
                  <TextRun>
                    <Value>=Fields!PrincArrears.Value</Value>
                    <Style>
                      <FontFamily>Times New Roman</FontFamily>
                      <Format>n2</Format>
                    </Style>
                  </TextRun>
                  <TextRun>
                    <Value> 
Penalty Arrears	Kes.</Value>
                    <Style>
                      <FontFamily>Times New Roman</FontFamily>
                    </Style>
                  </TextRun>
                  <TextRun>
                    <Value>=Fields!LedgArrears.Value</Value>
                    <Style>
                      <FontFamily>Times New Roman</FontFamily>
                      <Format>#,0.00;(#,0.00)</Format>
                    </Style>
                  </TextRun>
                  <TextRun>
                    <Value>
Ledger Fee Arrears	Kes.</Value>
                    <Style>
                      <FontFamily>Times New Roman</FontFamily>
                    </Style>
                  </TextRun>
                  <TextRun>
                    <Value>=Fields!PenArrears.Value</Value>
                    <Style>
                      <FontFamily>Times New Roman</FontFamily>
                      <Format>n2</Format>
                    </Style>
                  </TextRun>
                  <TextRun>
                    <Value> 
Total Arrears	Kes. </Value>
                    <Style>
                      <FontFamily>Times New Roman</FontFamily>
                    </Style>
                  </TextRun>
                  <TextRun>
                    <Value>=Fields!IntArrears.Value+Fields!PenArrears.Value+Fields!PrincArrears.Value+Fields!LedgArrears.Value</Value>
                    <Style>
                      <FontFamily>Times New Roman</FontFamily>
                      <Format>n2</Format>
                    </Style>
                  </TextRun>
                  <TextRun>
                    <Value>
Outstanding Loan Balance	Kes. </Value>
                    <Style>
                      <FontFamily>Times New Roman</FontFamily>
                    </Style>
                  </TextRun>
                  <TextRun>
                    <Value>=Fields!Outstanding_Balance.Value</Value>
                    <Style>
                      <FontFamily>Times New Roman</FontFamily>
                      <Format>n2</Format>
                    </Style>
                  </TextRun>
                  <TextRun>
                    <Value>

Kindly note that if the loan arrears are not settled within 14 (Fourteen) days from the date of this letter, we shall take the necessary steps to recover the same without further reference to you and your guarantors. We shall also list your name with the Credit Reference Bureaus.

We hope that the said course of action will not prove necessary as you will make every effort to pay these amounts.    

Yours Sincerely,


</Value>
                    <Style>
                      <FontFamily>Times New Roman</FontFamily>
                    </Style>
                  </TextRun>
                  <TextRun>
                    <Value>Credit Manager</Value>
                    <Style>
                      <FontFamily>Times New Roman</FontFamily>
                      <FontWeight>Bold</FontWeight>
                      <TextDecoration>Underline</TextDecoration>
                    </Style>
                  </TextRun>
                  <TextRun>
                    <Value>

Cc. Guarantors</Value>
                    <Style>
                      <FontFamily>Times New Roman</FontFamily>
                    </Style>
                  </TextRun>
                </TextRuns>
                <Style />
              </Paragraph>
              <Paragraph>
                <TextRuns>
                  <TextRun>
                    <Value xml:space="preserve">
</Value>
                    <Style>
                      <FontFamily>Times New Roman</FontFamily>
                    </Style>
                  </TextRun>
                </TextRuns>
                <Style />
              </Paragraph>
